<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
    <comment location="CreateComputePipelineAsyncCallbackInfoFFI">
        <summary>            
            Callback info struct used to register a callback for when a ComputePipeline is created via <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FFI.DeviceHandle.CreateComputePipelineAsync" />.
        </summary>
